                                                "sense_id": "c185ac90-986f-36c7-9db4-8b365a0c38a1",
                                                "text": "Uncle Charley's voice was very soft and there was a weary note in it. \"Great snarlin' catamounts, but I'm tired.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbe7dec4-17d2-4473-b217-e3e78ca31b19",
                                                "sense_id": "c185ac90-986f-36c7-9db4-8b365a0c38a1",
                                                "text": "'He would have rid that horse, too,' pa says, 'if I hadn't a stopped him. A durn spotted critter wilder than a catty-mount. A deliberate flouting of her and me.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7302ffa-4c22-3c19-a073-3ec9552889e1",
